ld-survival-game-3h4e">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>浏览器游戏地图的纹理图集实践</title><link>https://dev.to/denshin/texture-atlases-for-a-browser-game-map-52nn</link><description>DENSHIN 团队分享如何用纹理图集打造浏览器游戏里清晰可读的城市地图，从街道标线到车辆细节逐一拆解。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:05:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ae6b4d6079476a0a3032214e99c10f0c0c635e2d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/denshin/texture-atlases-for-a-browser-game-map-52nn">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>尽管 Skydance 裁员，《Marvel 1943: Rise of Hydra》据称已“接近完成”</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/despite-skydance-layoffs-marvel-1943-rise-of-hydra-is-reportedly-close-to-done</link><description>针对取消传闻的澄清：Skydance 裁员并未波及该项目，游戏据称已接近完成，独立开发者可从中观察大厂动荡下项目的实际进展。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:52:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">52715c6c06dce668bc527ae60bda9b2952742df9</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/despite-skydance-layoffs-marvel-1943-rise-of-hydra-is-reportedly-close-to-done">80 Level</source></item><item><title>Wild Shift 开发日志 #2：永远是分号的问题</title><link>https://dev.to/basteez/wild-shift-devlog-2-its-always-the-semicolon-3nje</link><description>作者分享参加 GitHub Game Off 2026 的参赛作品进展：修掉两个真实 bug、加入会说话的鸭子和新寄存器机制，记录一款小型解谜游戏的迭代过程。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:47:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">27ea711025d119f2baa30d11f07c07de35945cfe</guid><source url="https://dev.to/basteez/wild-shift-devlog-2-its-always-the-semicolon-3nje">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>被裁的 id Software 开发者组建员工持股工作室 Hidden Horses</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/laid-off-id-software-devs-form-employee-owned-studio-hidden-horses</link><description>一批受 Xbox 大规模裁员波及的 id Software 开发者自立门户，成立了员工持股的独立工作室 Hidden Horses，独立团队可以留意这种组织形式。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:17:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1721d2c71b62b075637189c994966d075e239209</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/laid-off-id-software-devs-form-employee-owned-studio-hidden-horses">Games